{"type":"after","callId":"call@23","endTime":4716.178,"result":{"value":"NEED HELP?\nSetup / Support\nNEED HELP?\nSetup / Support\nChurvox\nAI admin command centre\nInside\nFeatures\nPricing\nLog in\nStart free\n\nBUILT FOR TRADE AND SERVICE OWNERS\n\nRun the job. Churvox handles the admin.\n\nJobs, clients, crew, quotes, invoices and proof of work stay connected. Churvox prepares the next admin action so you can review it, approve it and move on.\n\nStart free\nSee pricing\nNo-card trial\nOwner approves first\nMobile crew workflow\nMYOB ready\nPREPARED BY CHURVOX\nAdmin ready to approve.\nPrepared from today’s jobs, notes, photos and customer activity.\nINVOICE DRAFT\nCompleted job, proof photos and wording prepared.\nApprove\nQUOTE FOLLOW-UP\nCustomer chase message written for review.\nApprove\nCREW MATCH\nBest available worker suggested before dispatch.\nApprove\nPAYMENT REMINDER\nPolite reminder drafted before money goes stale.\nApprove\n\nTHE REAL PROBLEM\n\nMost apps track the work. The admin still lands on you.\nChurvox is built for the mess after the job: invoices, proof, follow-ups, dispatch decisions, payroll review and customer updates.\nFinished jobs still need invoices.\nPhotos and notes get buried.\nQuotes go quiet.\nOwners forget the next step.\n\nWHAT CHURVOX CONNECTS\n\nOne clean workflow from job to approval.\nEverything is kept simple: work comes in, crew go out, proof comes back, Churvox prepares the admin, and the owner approves the next move.\nJobs\nCreate, assign and track work without losing the admin trail.\nClients\nKeep customer details, job history, quotes and invoices connected.\nQuotes\nPrepare quotes and follow-ups before the lead goes cold.\nInvoices\nTurn completed jobs into draft invoices ready to approve.\nCrew\nGive workers a simple job view while owners keep control.\nPayroll\nReview approved time and payroll handoff without hunting.\n\nINSIDE THE APP\n\nThe logged-in app becomes your Command Desk.\nSmart Hub shows what needs attention, what Churvox prepared and what button to press next. No giant website boxes. No confusing admin maze.\nToday’s owner queue\nDraft invoices ready\nQuote follow-ups prepared\nWorker assignment suggestions\nPayroll and time review\nMYOB sync when ready\n\nSIMPLE PROMISE\n\nChurvox prepares it. You approve it.\nStart with jobs and clients. Grow into prepared owner actions, crew workflow, invoices, quotes, payroll workspace and MYOB sync when ready.\nStart free\nChurvox\nAI admin command centre for trade and service owners.\nPricing\nFeatures\nPrivacy\nTerms\nLog in"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@23"}
